# Costume Closet: "Equipment, Auras you control, and counters are modifications" (CR 700.9). Bot1's Ornithopter carries Web-Shooters, so it is
# a modified creature though it has no counter. When Bot2 exiles it with Swords to Plowshares the Equipment is still attached as it
# leaves (CR 603.10a), so the Closet gets a counter and has three.

[Bot1 Deck]
Costume Closet
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Web-Shooters
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x20

